Delay 1 ms
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 1 ms
Delay 2 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 3 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 0 1
Delay 6 ms
MoveR -1 1
Delay 31 ms
LeftUp 1
MoveR 0 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Heroes And Generals</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>